{"page":395,"width":1666,"height":2333,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"union-find 연산의 구현","words":[{"text":"union-find","x":176,"y":185,"width":167,"height":34},{"text":"연산의","x":358,"y":185,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"구현","x":469,"y":186,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"집합을 구현하는 데는 여러 가지 빙卜법이 있을수 있다. 즉 비트 벡터. 배열. 연길 리스트를 이용","words":[{"text":"집합을","x":177,"y":252,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"구현하는","x":269,"y":252,"width":109,"height":31},{"text":"데는","x":390,"y":254,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"여러","x":454,"y":254,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"가지","x":516,"y":255,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"빙卜법이","x":579,"y":256,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"있을수","x":668,"y":256,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":767,"y":257,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"즉","x":835,"y":259,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"비트","x":874,"y":258,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"벡터.","x":935,"y":258,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"배열.","x":1006,"y":257,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"연길","x":1078,"y":256,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"리스트를","x":1142,"y":256,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"이용","x":1257,"y":256,"width":51,"height":30}]},{"text":"하여 구현될 수 있다. 그러나 가장 효율적인 방법은 트리 형태를 사용하는 것이다. 우리는 부모","words":[{"text":"하여","x":175,"y":304,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"구현될","x":242,"y":305,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":335,"y":305,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":375,"y":305,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"그러나","x":447,"y":306,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"가장","x":538,"y":307,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"효율적인","x":600,"y":306,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"방법은","x":715,"y":308,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"트리","x":802,"y":308,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"형태를","x":865,"y":309,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"사용하는","x":953,"y":309,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":1069,"y":308,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"우리는","x":1166,"y":307,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"부모","x":1256,"y":308,"width":52,"height":29}]},{"text":"노드만 알면 되므로 “부모 포인터 표현”을 사용한다. “부모 포인터 표현”이란 각 노드에 대해 그","words":[{"text":"노드만","x":174,"y":357,"width":84,"height":29},{"text":"알면","x":270,"y":356,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"되므로","x":335,"y":356,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"“부모","x":425,"y":357,"width":63,"height":30},{"text":"포인터","x":498,"y":358,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"표현”을","x":587,"y":358,"width":89,"height":30},{"text":"사용한다.","x":685,"y":358,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"“부모","x":809,"y":360,"width":61,"height":29},{"text":"포인터","x":881,"y":360,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"표현”이란","x":969,"y":360,"width":114,"height":30},{"text":"각","x":1094,"y":360,"width":26,"height":29},{"text":"노드에","x":1130,"y":359,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"대해","x":1221,"y":358,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"그","x":1283,"y":362,"width":25,"height":22}]},{"text":"노드의 부모에 대한 포인터만 저장하는 것이다. 이것은 일반직인 목적에는 부적합하다. 즉 노드","words":[{"text":"노드의","x":174,"y":409,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"부모에","x":269,"y":408,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"대한","x":362,"y":408,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"포인터만","x":424,"y":408,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"저장하는","x":541,"y":409,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":656,"y":409,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"이것은","x":753,"y":410,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"일반직인","x":842,"y":411,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"목적에는","x":953,"y":412,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"부적합하다.","x":1068,"y":410,"width":138,"height":31},{"text":"즉","x":1220,"y":411,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"노드","x":1257,"y":413,"width":52,"height":22}]},{"text":"의 가장 왼쪽 자식 또는 오른쪽 자식을 찾는 것과 같은 중요한 작업에는 부적절하기 때문이다.","words":[{"text":"의","x":175,"y":461,"width":24,"height":30},{"text":"가장","x":214,"y":460,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"왼쪽","x":282,"y":460,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"자식","x":348,"y":459,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"또는","x":413,"y":460,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"오른쪽","x":477,"y":461,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"자식을","x":567,"y":460,"width":78,"height":3